|passage=At the 1,000-metres post we gave a '''ten''', which raised our lead to 1&frac23; lengths; the Belgians were rowing hard, but one felt that they still had plenty of spurting power.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1982|author=Stanley French|title=Aspects of Downing history|page=105
|passage=Morris gave a '''ten''', and an unbelievable surge ran through the boat, one that I had never felt before.}}

